  <ButtonText>k__BackingField: "Ynna tu dois rendre \xE0 Herlock ce qu\u2019il a
    perdu \xE0 cause de toi."
  <NpcText>k__BackingField:
  - <Npc>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 292bca25009c3b846973697c392c826a, type: 2}
    <Expression>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 15a032d1f64921b49a6cec6c0a26887d, type: 2}
    <Text>k__BackingField:
    - "-C\u2019est ce que j\u2019aimerais au moins oui, m\xEAme si c\u2019est le
      minimum que je peux faire."
  - <Npc>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 292bca25009c3b846973697c392c826a, type: 2}
    <Expression>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3973df86522e4b743879172e3518e737, type: 2}
    <Text>k__BackingField:
    - "Peu m\u2019importe d\u2019\xEAtre seul si c\u2019est ce qu\u2019il faut.\r\n"
